"}],"rationale":"按全22段明示姓名與局部敘事暫接。太子完考烈王、李園女弟與所生太子楚幽王按明示敘事分存，血緣不當已核定史實。更立君後的君未解，實楚王評論指春申權勢，王長反政與君子為王只作假設；未把方案當實授。秦楚齊王稱分範圍，先君善秦未強接頃襄；朱英郎中未行，伊尹周公引古不補未見身份。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:p013","text":"趙平原君使人於春申君，春申君捨之於上舍。趙使欲夸楚，為瑁簪，刀劍室以珠玉飾之，請命春申君客。春申君客三千餘人，其上客皆躡珠履以見趙使，趙使大慚。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m013-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"趙平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004455","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m013-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"使人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名角色或假設用稱保留，不補姓名、親屬或方案實施；母子血緣敘事仍待另存來源主張與學術覆核。"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m013-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"春申君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004439","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m013-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"春申君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004439","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m013-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"趙使","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004458","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m013-0041","start":41,"end":44,"surface":"春申君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004439","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m013-0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"客","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名角色或假設用稱保留，不補姓名、親屬或方案實施；母子血緣敘事仍待另存來源主張與學術覆核。"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m013-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"春申君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004439","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m013-0049","start":49,"end":50,"surface":"客","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名角色或假設用稱保留，不補姓名、親屬或方案實施；母子血緣敘事仍待另存來源主張與學術覆核。"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m013-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"上客","kind":"unresolv